# A field read through a root-level own reference holding nothing, no handler: R0 is stopped natively and with the root
# walked (Fails 1, Stopped 1, Thrown 4).  Before: natively the field-path invariant (abort), walked INVALID.
Model: (int: v 11; int: spare 99)
box: @: Model: 0
int: got box\v
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
